## SnowGlow server env
#
# Optional: use your local browser cookies for yt-dlp.
# This can help for some YouTube URLs that fail with 403/signature errors.
#
# Examples:
# - edge
# - chrome
# - firefox
#
# See yt-dlp docs: --cookies-from-browser
#
# YTDLP_COOKIES_FROM_BROWSER=edge

# Allowed CORS origins (comma-separated).
# For example, if your frontend is served from CloudFront:
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://example.com

